                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h3>Comfort Food</h3>
                            <p>Hearty meals and tasty bites made for road-trip travelers.</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="feature-card">
                        <img
                          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528605248634-43f7d85d3287?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80"
